{"asset_key":"ep3/env_story_13303800","episode":"ep3","category":"env_story","story_id":"13303800","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1330380001:1":{"text":"맞아, 맞아! 이번엔 만약이 아니라 확실하단 말이야. 이건 세인트 킨가 성당의 수도사들이 한 말이라고!","source_cn":"对啊对啊，没有万一，绝对是一万，这可是圣金嘉的修士们说的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7E0E46721745BE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1330380002:1":{"text":"안 믿어! 저번에는 살아있는 시체가 눈사람으로 변장했다고 말하는 바람에 귀여운 눈사람 근처에도 못 갔단 말이야!","source_cn":"我不会相信你了，你上次说活死人伪装成雪人，害得我一直不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A6EFD55C790B505","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1330380003:1":{"text":"세인트 킨가 성당의 수도사도 안 믿는 거야?","source_cn":"圣金嘉的修士你都不信吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D2F7D1F62B9E1F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1330380004:1":{"text":"널 못 믿는 거야!","source_cn":"我是不相信你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA21C60CB47AB25D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小孩尤金":{"text":"유진","source":"小孩尤金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:小孩拉里莎":{"text":"아이 라리사","source":"小孩拉里莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}